# C2-S05 / C2-S08 — Command Hall, and the arena invitation.
# Source: Production Master 2.1, lines 2227–2326.
# Scene: scenes/chapter2/seraphina_encounter.tscn (the story gate "Command Hall").
# Seraphina is Knight-Commander, not ruler: Brask sits on the same council and
# makes stability's case without being a caricature.

~ start
do hall
Brask: Another outsider. The gate log says the Commander signed him in.
Seraphina: Him and one more. He's come from further away than most.
Brask: Distance doesn't go in a report. Origin does.
Elara: He survived Oakhaven. Oakhaven mostly survived him, and Mara billed him for the difference.
Brask: Oakhaven isn't my wall. Ironhold is.
Brask: State your business with Ironhold. Briefly. I have a wall report at noon.
? Kaelen (Internal): A room full of soldiers, and every one of them is waiting on me. How much do I tell them?
- Everything. The Source Key, and what Root Access lets me do. => truth
- Just enough. The Fracture's moving in a pattern, and the pattern ends here. => cautious
- Easier if I show you. (Edit the practice construct.) => showoff

~ truth
set ch2_seraphina_truth
do trust seraphina 10
Kaelen: There's a key in seven pieces; I found one under Oakhaven. And I can edit things. It costs me something, and I don't know what yet.
Brask: That goes in my report as the most dangerous thing said in this hall. Possibly the most honest. I'll find out which.
Seraphina: Two minutes in this hall, and they've had more out of you than I got at the gate.
Kaelen: You were holding a spear at the time. I was choosing my words around it.
Seraphina: I'm still holding a spear.
=> invitation

~ cautious
set ch2_seraphina_cautious
Kaelen: The Fracture moves in patterns, and the patterns point here. I'd rather know why before it reaches your wall.
Brask: That's a soldier's answer. I've given too many of them to trust one.
Seraphina: You left something out. Passengers sound like that when I ask what's in the bag.
Kaelen: Ask me again somewhere with fewer spears in it.
=> invitation

~ showoff
set ch2_seraphina_showoff
do trust seraphina -10
do root_edit construct
# The training construct bows to the council. Nobody in the hall moves.
Brask: Put it back. Exactly how it was.
Seraphina: Hands where they are, everyone, please. ...That's a useful thing to be able to do.
Kaelen: That almost sounded like you were impressed.
Seraphina: I'm concerned. It sounds similar from the outside.
=> invitation

# C2-S08 — the arena trial.
~ invitation
Seraphina: There's an arena trial. Win enough rounds, and command will trust you near the lower city.
Kaelen: Why does winning a fight get me into the sewers? I'm not even sure I can win one.
Seraphina: Tradition. Ironhold runs on it, and on coal.
Kaelen: That's not a reason, though. That's just a description of what happens.
Seraphina: It's the only one anybody's given me, and I've asked.
Seraphina: One more thing, please. Rem at the infirmary needs hands. Fever's in the lower city, and the medicine's stuck out on the west road.
set ch2_command_hall_done
set ch2_arena_unlocked
